# Which files in this repository are served to a browser. Same format as
# .gitignore, read from the assets directory — the whole repository, per
# wrangler.jsonc.
#
# This lists what IS served. The first line excludes everything and each line
# after it puts one thing back, so a new file in the root (notes, the CSV, a
# .env) is private until someone adds it here.

/*

!/index.html
!/_headers
!/assets
